From: Lukas Klizas <lukas@klizas.lt>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amd/pm: allow DFLL PLL shutdown during GFXOFF on Navi 14

navi10_append_powerplay_table() sets
DPM_OVERRIDE_DISABLE_DFLL_PLL_SHUTDOWN whenever GFXOFF is enabled,
tagged "TODO: remove it once SMU fw fix it" with no firmware version
gate. The gfx DFLL PLL therefore stays powered through every GFXOFF
cycle on all navi1x, on every PMFW ever released.

Skip the override when MP1 is IP version 11.0.5 (Navi 14). Navi 10 and
Navi 12 keep it.
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/swsmu/smu11/navi10_ppt.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/swsmu/smu11/navi10_ppt.c
index 6dfc3b585..b549a6125 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/swsmu/smu11/navi10_ppt.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/swsmu/smu11/navi10_ppt.c
@@ -450,7 +450,8 @@ static int navi10_append_powerplay_table(struct smu_context *smu)
 
 	if (adev->pm.pp_feature & PP_GFXOFF_MASK) {
 		/* TODO: remove it once SMU fw fix it */
-		smc_pptable->DebugOverrides |= DPM_OVERRIDE_DISABLE_DFLL_PLL_SHUTDOWN;
+		if (amdgpu_ip_version(adev, MP1_HWIP, 0) != IP_VERSION(11, 0, 5))
+			smc_pptable->DebugOverrides |= DPM_OVERRIDE_DISABLE_DFLL_PLL_SHUTDOWN;
 	}
 
 	return 0;
